<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>AST Data Flow Test</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 32px;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f8fafc;
        color: #0f172a;
      }

      .card {
        max-width: 880px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 24px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      }

      h1 {
        margin-top: 0;
      }

      code,
      pre {
        font-family: Consolas, "Courier New", monospace;
      }

      pre {
        background: #0f172a;
        color: #e2e8f0;
        padding: 16px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: auto;
      }

      .result {
        margin-top: 16px;
        padding: 16px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: #eef2ff;
        border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.14);
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="card">
      <h1>AST Data Flow 本地测试页</h1>
      <p>这个页面专门用于验证系统里的 <code>ast_data_flow</code> 规则。</p>
      <p>建议扫描地址：</p>
      <pre>http://127.0.0.1:5173/ast_data_flow_test.html?payload=Zxz_xss_payload</pre>

      <p>本页包含的核心链路是：</p>
      <pre>location.search -> queryValue -> reflectedHtml -> output.innerHTML</pre>

      <div id="output" class="result">等待脚本填充内容...</div>
    </div>

    <script>
      const params = new URLSearchParams(location.search);
      const queryValue = params.get("payload") || location.search;
      const reflectedHtml = queryValue;
      document.getElementById("output").innerHTML = reflectedHtml;
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
